  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarships Tracer Study 2026-2041</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Longitudinal tracer study of Manaaki New Zealand Scholarship Programme (MNZSP) alumni. Participants will be graduates of all MNZSP schemes - tertiary and short-term training. There will be a &apos;light&apos; tracer annually, replaced by a deep dive every five years. Participating alumni will be contacted through a &apos;rolling sample&apos; approach, with each alum contacted every four-five years. The activity funding includes the tracer studies, analytics, knowledge management, communications, and reporting.</narrative>
  </description>
